    <element kind="textField" uuid="0d92d253-c4b3-4212-9e76-cc0c0fb60021" x="300" y="174" width="264" height="38" fontName="DejaVu Sans" fontSize="9" bold="true" hTextAlign="Right"><expression><![CDATA["TOTAL LIABILITIES: "+$P{totalLiabilities}+"\nNET WORTH: "+$P{netWorth}]]></expression></element>
    <element kind="staticText" uuid="0d92d253-c4b3-4212-9e76-cc0c0fb60022" x="0" y="220" width="564" height="20" fontName="DejaVu Sans" fontSize="9" bold="true" mode="Opaque" backcolor="#D9E8F0"><text><![CDATA[BUSINESS INTERESTS AND FINANCIAL CONNECTIONS]]></text></element>
    <element kind="textField" uuid="0d92d253-c4b3-4212-9e76-cc0c0fb60023" x="0" y="240" width="564" height="145" fontName="DejaVu Sans Mono" fontSize="7" textAdjust="StretchHeight"><expression><![CDATA[$P{businessInterests}]]></expression><box><pen lineWidth="0.5"/></box></element>
    <element kind="staticText" uuid="0d92d253-c4b3-4212-9e76-cc0c0fb60024" x="0" y="394" width="564" height="20" fontName="DejaVu Sans" fontSize="9" bold="true" mode="Opaque" backcolor="#D9E8F0"><text><![CDATA[RELATIVES IN THE GOVERNMENT SERVICE]]></text></element>
    <element kind="textField" uuid="0d92d253-c4b3-4212-9e76-cc0c0fb60025" x="0" y="414" width="564" height="145" fontName="DejaVu Sans Mono" fontSize="7" textAdjust="StretchHeight"><expression><![CDATA[$P{governmentRelatives}]]></expression><box><pen lineWidth="0.5"/></box></element>
    <element kind="staticText" uuid="0d92d253-c4b3-4212-9e76-cc0c0fb60026" x="0" y="574" width="564" height="118" fontName="DejaVu Sans" fontSize="8" hTextAlign="Justified"><text><![CDATA[I hereby certify that these are true and correct statements of my assets, liabilities, net worth, business interests and financial connections, including those of my spouse and unmarried children below eighteen (18) years of age living in my household, and that to the best of my knowledge the above-enumerated are names of my relatives in government within the fourth civil degree of consanguinity or affinity.

I authorize the Ombudsman or duly authorized representative to obtain from appropriate government agencies documents that may show the declared information covering previous years, including the year I first assumed office in government.]]></text></element>
    <element kind="textField" uuid="0d92d253-c4b3-4212-9e76-cc0c0fb60027" x="0" y="710" width="280" height="70" fontName="DejaVu Sans" fontSize="8"><expression><![CDATA["Date: "+$P{filingDate}+"\n\nSignature of Declarant: ________________________"]]></expression></element>
    <element kind="textField" uuid="0d92d253-c4b3-4212-9e76-cc0c0fb60028" x="284" y="710" width="280" height="70" fontName="DejaVu Sans" fontSize="8"><expression><![CDATA[$P{governmentId}]]></expression></element>
    <element kind="staticText" uuid="0d92d253-c4b3-4212-9e76-cc0c0fb60029" x="0" y="800" width="564" height="60" fontName="DejaVu Sans" fontSize="8"><text><![CDATA[SUBSCRIBED AND SWORN to before me this ____ day of ______________, affiant exhibiting the government-issued identification stated above.

Person Administering Oath: _______________________________________________]]></text></element>
